Install
    sudo apt install stow git
    git clone git@github.com:dozheiny/dotfiles.git ~/dotfiles
    cd ~/dotfiles
    stow .

If files already exist in $HOME, stow stops with a conflict. To take them over:
    stow --adopt .    # moves your existing files into this repo
    git diff          # shows what they changed

Secrets
    Machine-local values go in ~/.config/fish/conf.d/local.fish, which is ignored.
    This repo is public. .gitignore is an allowlist, so a new config folder must
    be added there before git sees it.

Hyprland packages
    .config/hypr/install-deps.sh
